@Products_HostAddress = http://localhost:5297

### Get the whole catalog
GET {{Products_HostAddress}}/api/product/
Accept: application/json

### Get a single product
GET {{Products_HostAddress}}/api/product/1
Accept: application/json

### Keyword search - matches because "water" is a substring of "waterproof"
GET {{Products_HostAddress}}/api/product/search/water
Accept: application/json

### Keyword search - returns nothing, even though the sleeping bag is the obvious answer
GET {{Products_HostAddress}}/api/product/search/warm%20at%20night
Accept: application/json

###
